{
  "id": "349",
  "title": "Checking in at the Airport",
  "level": "upper intermediate",
  "date": "2017-08-10",
  "synopsis": "There's a lot of vocabulary to learn if you want to check in at the airport in Chinese.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/487/8d26528c4b0e03a655ce854ae64ec931794e5957.mp3?1575021156",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "请出示您的机票和护照\n\n工作人员：您好！请出示您的机票和护照。\n本：您好！给！我可以要一个靠窗的座位吗？\n工作人员：没问题。请稍等……不好意思，没有靠窗的座位了。\n本：没关系。靠过道的也行。\n工作人员：好的。您有行李要托运吗？\n本：有一件。\n工作人员：不好意思，您的行李超重了。\n本：那我把书拿出来。现在可以了吗？\n工作人员：可以了。这是您的机票、护照和登机牌。登机时间是6点50分。登机口在15号。\n本：好的。谢谢！\n工作人员：祝您旅途愉快！",
    "traditional": "請出示您的機票和護照\n\n工作人員：您好！請出示您的機票和護照。\n本：您好！給！我可以要一個靠窗的座位嗎？\n工作人員：沒問題。請稍等……不好意思，沒有靠窗的座位了。\n本：沒關係。靠過道的也行。\n工作人員：好的。您有行李要托運嗎？\n本：有一件。\n工作人員：不好意思，您的行李超重了。\n本：那我把書拿出來。現在可以了嗎？\n工作人員：可以了。這是您的機票、護照和登機牌。登機時間是6點50分。登機口在15號。\n本：好的。謝謝！\n工作人員：祝您旅途愉快！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Please show your flight ticket and passport"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "工作人员：您好！请出示您的机票和护照。",
      "traditional": "工作人員：您好！請出示您的機票和護照。",
      "pinyin": "gōng zuò rén yuán nín hǎo qǐng chū shì nín de jī piào hé hù zhào",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Staff: Hello! Please show your flight ticket and passport."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "本：您好！给！我可以要一个靠窗的座位吗？",
      "traditional": "本：您好！給！我可以要一個靠窗的座位嗎？",
      "pinyin": "běn nín hǎo gěi wǒ kě yǐ yào yí ge kào chuāng de zuò wèi ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Hello! Here! Can I have a window seat?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "工作人员：没问题。请稍等……不好意思，没有靠窗的座位了。",
      "traditional": "工作人員：沒問題。請稍等……不好意思，沒有靠窗的座位了。",
      "pinyin": "gōng zuò rén yuán méi wèn tí qǐng shāo děng bù hǎo yì si méi yǒu kào chuāng de zuò wèi le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Staff: No problem, wait a second… Sorry, there are no window seats left."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "本：没关系。靠过道的也行。",
      "traditional": "本：沒關係。靠過道的也行。",
      "pinyin": "běn méi guān xi kào guò dào de yě xíng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: That's ok. Aisle seat is fine too."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "工作人员：好的。您有行李要托运吗？",
      "traditional": "工作人員：好的。您有行李要托運嗎？",
      "pinyin": "gōng zuò rén yuán hǎo de nín yǒu xíng li yào tuō yùn ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Staff: Ok. Do you have any luggage to check in?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "本：有一件。",
      "traditional": "本：有一件。",
      "pinyin": "běn yǒu yí jiàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: I have one."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "工作人员：不好意思，您的行李超重了。",
      "traditional": "工作人員：不好意思，您的行李超重了。",
      "pinyin": "gōng zuò rén yuán bù hǎo yì si nín de xíng li chāo zhòng le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Staff: Sorry, your bag is too heavy."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "本：那我把书拿出来。现在可以了吗？",
      "traditional": "本：那我把書拿出來。現在可以了嗎？",
      "pinyin": "běn nà wǒ bǎ shū ná chū lái xiàn zài kě yǐ le ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: I'll take out the books then. Is it ok now?"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "工作人员：可以了。这是您的机票、护照和登机牌。",
      "traditional": "工作人員：可以了。這是您的機票、護照和登機牌。",
      "pinyin": "gōng zuò rén yuán kě yǐ le zhè shì nín de jī piào hù zhào hé dēng jī pái",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "simplified": "登机时间是6点50分。登机口在15号。",
      "traditional": "登機時間是6點50分。登機口在15號。",
      "pinyin": "dēng jī shí jiān shì 1 diǎn 2 fēn dēng jī kǒu zài 2 hào",
      "english": "Staff: Yes. Here's your ticket, passport and boarding pass."
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "The boarding time is 6:50. Your gate is number 15."
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "simplified": "本：好的。谢谢！",
      "traditional": "本：好的。謝謝！",
      "pinyin": "běn hǎo de xiè xie",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Ok, thank you!"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "simplified": "工作人员：祝您旅途愉快！",
      "traditional": "工作人員：祝您旅途愉快！",
      "pinyin": "gōng zuò rén yuán zhù nín lǚ tú yú kuài",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Staff: I wish you a pleasant trip!"
    }
  ],
